{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1772744368\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY TO BUILD YOUR MOTORCYCLE EMPIRE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Motorcycle For Sale Simulator</i> and transform rusty, forgotten bikes into the dream rides everyone wants. Start small, take risks, and grow your own motorcycle dealership from barn finds to high-end superbikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.poster.avif?t=1772744368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/e45e7356e8d48f4af72942d5d95831f1.webm?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY, FIX, CUSTOMIZE, SELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the market to find cheap motorcycles. Use your skills to clean, repair, and tune every part engine, exhaust, tires, paint jobs, and custom decals. Take each bike for a test ride, show it off, and get the best deal from your buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/21e02f01945f0bb0d6621755fcb6e79f.poster.avif?t=1772744368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/21e02f01945f0bb0d6621755fcb6e79f.webm?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/21e02f01945f0bb0d6621755fcb6e79f.mp4?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, RIDE, AND INTERACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through the city, push the limits on highways, and weave through traffic. Rev your engine to catch attention, meet NPCs on the street, and even invite special passengers for a spin. Build relationships and become a legend in the biker community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/49e1a7078feaf4933daa648bc5cdad6e.poster.avif?t=1772744368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/49e1a7078feaf4933daa648bc5cdad6e.webm?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721530/extras/49e1a7078feaf4933daa648bc5cdad6e.mp4?t=1772744368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR SHOP AND LIFESTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your workshop and showroom to handle more bikes. Buy your own house to rest, fast-forward time, and manage your growing business. Keep an eye on fuel levels and hit the gas station when you run low no fuel, no fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DEEP, IMMERSIVE SIMULATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From negotiating with sellers to managing repairs and 